<title>PORTUGAL: Argentaria issues 10 bln esc 10-yr Navigator.</title>
<headline>Argentaria issues 10 bln esc 10-yr Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentaria Global Finance Limited is issuing a 10-year 10 billion escudos Navigator indexed to six-month Lisbor plus 27 basis points with a cap of nine percent, the leaders of the operation Banco Cisf and Banco de Negocios Argentaria said.  </p>
<p>Issuer: Argentaria Global Finance Limited</p>
<p>Guarantor: Corporacion Bancaria de Espana</p>
<p>Rating: Aa3 (Moody's), A+ (Standard &amp; Poors)</p>
<p>Amount: 10 bln esc</p>
<p>Maturity: 11 July 2007 (10 year-bullet)</p>
<p>Liquidation: 11 July 1997</p>
<p>Issue price: 100.0 percent</p>
<p>Admission to listing: London stock exchange</p>
<p>Interest rate: 6-mth Lisbor +27 bp, subject to maximum interest rate Cap: 9 percent</p>
<p>Date of payment of interest: 11 Jan and 11 July each year Status: Senior and pari passu</p>
<p>Convenants: Cross default, negative pledge and force majeure</p>
<p>Law: English</p>
<p>Lead managers: Banco Cisf (bookrunner) and Banco de Negocios</p>
<p>Argentaria</p>
<p>Portuguese paying agent: Banco Comercial Portugues</p>
<p>Liquidation: Euroclear/Cedel</p>
<p>Commissions: 0.15 percent upfront</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
